    "renewal_note": "There is no statutory refresher requirement for licensed radio amateurs; the 24-month figure is a de facto best-practice review interval for this module's content, not a legal mandate. IMPORTANT SOURCE-CURRENCY FLAG: the BNetzA Fragenkataloge used as structural/topical reference for this module are dated 2006 (1st edition) and this pilot's authors could not confirm from the fetched BNetzA overview page whether a newer edition has since been published - re-check bundesnetzagentur.de for a current-edition PDF before production use. Separately, the AFuV text itself has been amended multiple times since 2006 (e.g. Sec. 13a Remote-Betrieb, references to the 2017 Funkanlagengesetz/EMVG 2016, and periodic changes to the Anlage 1 frequency/band-plan table, including newer allocations such as the 60 m band) - legal_basis citations in this file were checked against the AFuV text as consolidated on gesetze-im-internet.de on 2026-08-11, but frequency-band figures, power limits and any Klasse E vs Klasse A distinctions MUST be re-verified against the then-current Anlage 1 and Amtsblatt notices before commercial/production use, since band plans and permitted power levels are exactly the kind of detail that changes between catalog editions.",
